{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-06-08 18:45:00', 'title': 'VTRS INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD VIATRIS INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES\xa0, JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST VIATRIS INC. ("VIATRIS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: VTRS). CLASS PERIOD: MARCH 1, 2021 – FEBRUARY 25, 2022\xa0 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JULY 14, 2023 IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF OF THE VIATRIS LAWSUIT, YOU CAN SUBMIT YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AT WWW.GLANCYLAW.COM/CASES/VIATRIS-INC/.'}